Let $v\in\bar K_\Gamma$. The mapping $g$ is 2-nondegenerate in direction $v$ at $\bar y$ if
\[
\left.
\begin{array}{c}
\nabla^2(\mu^Tg)(\bar y)v\in N_{\bar K_\Gamma}(v)-N_{\bar K_\Gamma}(v),\\
\mu\in\operatorname{span}\bigl(\bar\Lambda(v)-\bar\Lambda(v)\bigr)
\end{array}
\right\}
\quad\Longrightarrow\quad \mu=0.
\]

